{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1417835-what-if-the-sabbat-beat-the-camarilla","id":1417835,"title":"What if the Sabbat beat the Camarilla?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-12T09:27:30-07:00","id":1417835,"title":"What if the Sabbat beat the Camarilla?","content":"Okay I was thinking going off revised what if the Sabbat won their war with the Camarilla? So say the Gangrel left, and the Brujah start contemplating leaving. Al Ashrad brings his Bani Haquim. But the big turning point is say out of the blue Karan disappears and Jalan Aajav becomes much more active for reasons... So several strategic battles are won by the Sabbat and the Sabbat make a point to consolidate their hold in South America and From their they take North America. Petty squabbles from Tremere and the Bani Haquim ramp up. Al-Ashrads faction dies out from the conflicts but also strikes from Ur Shulgi. The Tremere backs to the wall get called out for creating new Gargoyles and they die out in the conflict as House Goreatrix reveals himself to be alive having maybe lowered his generation after a catastrophic ritual that killed most of his House and he assimilates most of the Tremere.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Theo Bell assassinates Hardstadt after finding out about a lot of dirty secrets. The Giovanni reading the winds of the future join the Sabbat and they crush the Cam in Europe, and Australia with most of the Cam who don\u2019t join the Anarchs become Independents.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> What do the Sabbat do now that their big rival is over? So they work on trying to bring a world they can rule openly or do they try to hunt the Antes first? War with the remaining independents and give them an Ultimatum? What do you think happens?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T09:33:46-07:00","id":1417836,"title":"","content":"They would probably then get smoked by humanity when they decided it's time to rule over the cattle.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-12T09:44:13-07:00","id":1417841,"title":"","content":"Turn on each other.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" tar